; des missiles a tete chercheuse. Un humain, si" — a real numeric edge on
; top of an AI dodge gap, so both get addressed: a modest homing_strength
; trim here (less relentless re-tracking, more escapable even by a
; simple dodge), paired with ship_node.gd's _ai_dodge_direction() now
; reacting earlier specifically to homing threats. Was 2.0, -20%.
